cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Per-label conformal calibration of an ECG classifier across hospitals
message: If you use this repository, please cite it as below.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Abbou
    given-names: Ruben
repository-code: https://github.com/rubenabbou/ecg-conformal-shift
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Measures what three ways of turning the same frozen ECG classifier scores
  into a clinical output deliver per label, and what happens to each when its
  calibration threshold is carried unchanged to hospitals of different
  myocardial infarction prevalence. PTB-XL as source, SPH (Shandong) and
  ACS-ECG (Chongqing) as targets.
keywords:
  - conformal prediction
  - electrocardiography
  - myocardial infarction
  - distribution shift
  - class-conditional coverage
